    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/2ee895c1b0a7e5802981df25e21befe2.avif?t=1754432730\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony 37</strong> is a sandbox survival game where you play as a simple miner, earning cash by gathering valuables from the underground. <i>But there is something more to find then just ore</i>. Pay attention to your oxygen level, watch where you step and get yourself a geiger counter , just in case there will be radioactive waste underground. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/70ddea53334d439bc208ae99d6f8fd43.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/96d66fd3a78933dbffa3bcb7217a63a1.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/55a13051275ec55fe6d7ab5a921f723c.avif?t=1754432730\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a <strong>handfull of features</strong> a game has to offer.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated world</strong> with different biomes and threats you're going to encounter.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various instruments </strong>and<strong> trinkets</strong> for you to use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay with<strong> story elements.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of resources</strong> to gather and sell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highscore</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/b833e5cacb7788bc6e382d368c56754f.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4bb027bcbbbc8507e5b3de66bf344286.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/6e02845c24152d67d267720ecde09285.avif?t=1754432730\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony 37</strong> can offer you plenty of <strong>various instruments</strong> and <strong>trinkets</strong> to aid you with mining operations. Enjoying explosives? Incredibly fast drills? Or maybe you're in to classic mining with a rusty pickaxe. Setup everything in your personal way to maximize profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/edd7016a09bd82c920c2c1c914dc21dd.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/6c695f489eacac76b5ffc6355cb59bd1.avif?t=1754432730\" width=426 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden secrets of a planet where your mining company is trying to make profit. Maybe you're not the first\u00a0discoverers of this forgotten place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.poster.avif?t=1754432730\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.webm?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c4432908e4b6e6f6999c404eab0612b7.mp4?t=1754432730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
